Wrote coder-2.json with one row for the `taxes` topic. Since both sources are two passages of the same instrument (SB 1828, 2021 omnibus tax act), and Marsh's only recorded action is a No vote on this multi-subject bill with no statement tying it to a specific clause, the row codes as `v6_blank_reason: "no-evidence"` per the V4.1 vote-ladder rule (a No on a multi-subject bill proves nothing).
